WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:06,670
The old immortal is offended

2
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,070
I hold you and walk fast

3
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:15,820
Thief, don't move

4
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,470
Fu Chunge

5
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,000
Xiaotie, you have returned to the village

6
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,360
Where did you catch this yellow guy?

7
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,400
Release it quickly. To protect animals, look behind you.

8
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:31,270
Wait until I come back to pay you back

9
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:34,270
Lao Xian, give me the direction

10
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:35,470
I put them in place

11
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,560
Be careful to catch him

12
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:42,800
Get through me first

13
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:02,260
Let's go, don't come out again
